    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "iso_note",
      "x": 60, "y": 752, "width": 1360, "height": 40,
      "text": "Tenant isolation (cross-cutting axis): per-tenant outbox + processed_events tables; dedicated tight-grant roles (outbox_relay, event_consumer); tenant_id on every outbox row, envelope & queue message; payloads carry entity refs + non-PII fields only.",
